# Motion system

- Animation library: **Framer Motion only**. Do not install or use GSAP until asked.
- Import shared timing from `src/motion` (`duration`, `ease`, `viewport`, variants).
- Do not invent one-off durations, springs, or bounce easings.
- Documentary feel: fade / slight Y / clip-path reveal. No playful springs.
- Page changes go through `PageTransition`. Scroll reveals use `fadeUp` / `reveal` / `ImageReveal`.
